torchtitan on torch_tpu, applied by docker/Dockerfile.tpu at TORCHTITAN_COMMIT; rebase it whenever that commit moves.
`patch` skips this text. Each hunk, and where it should end up:

- fsdp.py `_cpu_offload_policy`: generic torch_tpu support (pinned copies deadlock against compiled
  activation-checkpointed blocks on TPU). Upstream to torchtitan.
- tools/utils.py `_TpuDeviceModule`: generic torch_tpu support (torch.tpu refuses device calls from outside torch and
  lacks the memory-stats APIs torchtitan calls). Upstream to torchtitan as a torch.accelerator device module.

FSDP's force-SUM reduction (tpu_dist has no PREMUL_SUM) lives in miles (TitanTrainer, Platform.premul_sum_reduce).

